/mvnw text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Mark binary assets so git never treats them as text (no diff/normalize) and
# they can't masquerade as committable source. Encoding/line-ending of text
# files is nudged by .editorconfig + enforced by the pre-commit hooks; we
# deliberately avoid a repo-wide `text=auto eol=lf` here to skip a noisy
# renormalization of the existing tree.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.jar   binary
*.exe   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
